window.products.push({"id":780004,"name":"LED Strip Lights, Jabor 32.8Ft/10M 300LED Light Strip SMD 5050 Waterproof Flexible RGB Strip Lights with 44 keys IR Remote for Ceiling Bar Counter Cab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pucAPpPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Color Effect: Music string lights are suitable for various kinds of indoor decorations to create a classy, elegant, romantic or any other atmosphere you want. Colors, modes and brightness can be regulated with a remote control. RGB LED strip Make your life brighter with this colorful light strip. Premium-Quality Light Strips: 12V voltage, extremely low heat and safe. Every 3 leds can be cut off with no damage made to the rest of the LED lights.  The strips come with adhesive tape and 10 buckles, strong enough to attach the strip to the surface. RGB LED light strips have a IP65 water protection. Only LED strips are waterproof – the remote control and the power adapter aren’t. Create Any Shape You Want: LED light strips are flexible and can be curved in any shape you want whether it’s a simple figure, like square or oval, or something more creative, like Olympic Rings or a five-pointed star. You can make a shape of heart, turn on the red color to create a romantic atmosphere or you put them under the dining table to enjoy a colorful 'candlelight dinner' without candles. There are no limitations here – use your imagination and create your own shapes string lights. Wide Applications: LED strip light can be used in hotels, clubs, exhibition shows, shopping malls, weddings, and so on. The lights suit very well for lighting in living rooms, patios, garages, porches, etc. You can also use for decorating whatever you like whether it’s a computer desk, a car or bedroom, any room. The strips are an incredible addition to any holiday: Christmas, New Year, Thanksgiving day, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pucAPpPqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jabor","source_asin":"B0784MR3PQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0784MR3PQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0784MR3PQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":780005,"name":"ANPHSIN 13\" Oval Banneton Bread Proofing Basket Round Brotform Dough Rising with Liner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f-G+eCArL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need all-natural, self-rising bread making basket to make fresh, delicious homemade bread free of additives? Then it’s time to get the ANPHSIN Banneton Proofing Basket designed to make European-quality artisanal breads. Better Fermentation, Better Crust Make your boule artisan bread with the rattan proofing basket for rising sourdough and beautiful look of your bread. Package: 1 Basket * 1 Linen Liner * 1 Scraper Care & Use: 1. With natural smell of rattan, please wash the basket and liner with cold water, and let them hang dry thoroughly before first use. 2. Spray the basket lightly with cold water, dust with flour, sit for dry overnight. 3. Before proofing, sprinkle flour in the basket and swirl it round, empty out the excess, then place the shaped dough in upside down, seam on top, cover the banneton with a cloth and leave to prove. 4. Brush excess flour when finish, dry the liner and basket naturally and store in clean place or sealed bag. Always reflour before use. 5. Do not wash them frequently, it's better to put in ventilated and dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f-G+eCArL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANPHSIN","source_asin":"B072ZXRJGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072ZXRJGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072ZXRJGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
