window.products.push({"id":780147,"name":"DisplayGifts Elegant Solid Wood Flag Display Case Holder Stand only for Funeral Veteran Interment American Banner Flag Folded 5 x 9.5 Flag, Cherry Fin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GAYfVWPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why it is important to choose a SOLID wood and Real Glass for the flag case? Because they is a direct expression of how much you have RESPECT for the person. Don't get cheap Veneer or particle flag cases with cheap plastic or acrylic front which is not going to last long. Is this the right size? You may get the wrong size if you don't know what size of the flag is. Please confirm that it is a Memorial Funeral/Burial flag before buying. This is too large for a 3'X5' flag. We guarantee you will not be faulted with the QUALITY. Holds a Memorial Funeral/Burial/Casket draped 5'X9.5' folded. Wall mountable with metal brackets already on the back, or stands on a desk or table top. Attention: for large 5 X 9.5 ft Burial/Funeral Casket Draped Flag ONLY. Dimensions: 13.2 \"H X 25.25 \"W X 3.15\"D. Interior:11.5\"H X 23.5\"W X 2.35\"D The space on the beveled base where you can put a nameplate is 0.75' height. The Difference: We use 4mm glass is easier to clean and lasts longer while offering great protection. Most market frames use 1 mm paper thin acrylic which is more easier to scratch even with a cloth. See Customer feedback and Product Reviews for the quality. Don't get embarrassed with cheap quality veneer particle flag case with plastic acrylic front. This will make a great gift to anyone who has a relative in the military that has passed away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GAYfVWPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DisplayGifts","source_asin":"B01N3VDTBE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3VDTBE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3VDTBE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
