window.products.push({"id":780267,"name":"Robolife DC 12V Waterproof Cooling Fountain Brushless Water Pump","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gobw1U3sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"It can be widely used to cool and supply water for medical, industry, household application, etc. Besides, in garden sightseeing, music fountain, pet watering, soilless culture, and aquarium equipment, it plays an important role. Specifications: Working voltage: DC 12V Current: 400mA Max flowing quantity: 240l/h Noise: less than 45dB Max water distance: 300cm Note: Connect the wire correctly with negative and positiveClean the water frequency in case pump blockedIt is advised to use it under 35 Deg.C environment Material: Plastic Package weight: 0.11886 kg Product Size(L x W x H): 3.90 x 3.30 x 2.50 cm / 1.54 x 1.3 x 0.98 inches Package Size(L x W x H): 7.00 x 6.50 x 4.50 cm / 2.76 x 2.56 x 1.77 inches Package Contents: 1 x Water PumpIPXX Rating ChartIP CodeThe IP Code (or International Protection Rating, sometimes also interpreted as Ingress Protection Rating*) consists of the letters IP followed by two digits and an optional letter. As defined in international standard IEC 60529, it classifies the degrees of protection provided against the intrusion of solid objects (including body parts like hands and fingers), dust, accidental contact, and water in electrical enclosures. The standard aims to provide users more detailed information than vague marketing terms such as waterproof.The digits (characteristic numerals) indicate conformity with the conditions summarized in the tables below. For example, an electrical socket rated IP22 is protected against insertion of fingers and will not be damaged or become unsafe during a specified test in which it is exposed to vertically or nearly vertically dripping water. IP22 or 2X are typical minimum requirements for the design of electrical accessories for indoor use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gobw1U3sL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Robolife","source_asin":"B06WW1W7W2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WW1W7W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WW1W7W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
