window.products.push({"id":780340,"name":"JUDEL Personal Humidifier Portable USB Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier for Office Desk Desktop Car Travel Small Room 400ML Mini Bulb Water Bottle Air ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518ylROZkSL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This Personal Humidifier Cools and Moisturizes the dry air in your home or office. Produce atomize the water is 1 microns to 10 micron particles thereby achieving a uniform humidification,adds moisture and oxygen molecule to the air. Dramatically improve your general health and comfort,reduce dry skin and respiratory problems.Soothing,up to 99.9% moisture is emitted into the air as a fine visible mist to relieve dry air discomforts.Help alleviate many common nuisances brought on by winter heating,such as low humidity causes static electricity,peeling wallpaper,shrinking wood and cracks in paint and furniture. Personal Humidifier do not contain a heating element and are one of the safest for newborns and kids. Main material made of PET material,it is environment-friendly and has no harm to human body. No worry about the water sprayed.It's ideal to be used by children,old people and pregnant women.Automatic power-off after 6 hours of operation when water used up, which ensures safety and energy efficiency,it won't overheat or short circuit.Highlights:☆Portable,USB Powered☆Whisper quiet operation Zero radiation☆Waterless Auto Shut-off☆Colorful Nightlight☆Exquisitely tropical scenery desigSpecifications:Size: 6x3.5x3.5inch Input Voltage: DC5V Rated Power: 2W Operating Time: 6hours Net weight: 232G1X Bulb Shape Air Humidifier (Included 1pcs Sponge Filter)Add 1pcs Sponge filterNOTE:1.Use only water,please don't add essential oil or other chemical substance into water for humidifier longevity.2.Please clean it at least once a week.3.Please wait for 1-2 minutes after filling the water tank to make the new cotton filter absorb water completely.4.Please don't use the function of humidifying spray while lack of the water.5.To prolong the lifetime of the item, please keep it dry and clean when storing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518ylROZkSL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUDEL","source_asin":"B078M8L531","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078M8L531","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078M8L531","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
