window.products.push({"id":780349,"name":"Prestige Decanters Etched Spinning / Rocking Globe Whiskey Glass - 10oz Glass for Scotch, Rum, Tequila or Bourbon – Old Fashioned / Rocks Glasses from","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uXSViEjdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever wondered what it’s like to hold the world in the palm of your hand? Power. Authority. Command. You don’t have to be a mogul, a baron, a businessman. Because what you do doesn’t define how you feel, and isn’t that what counts? The spinning globe whiskey glass isn’t about what you do either.  It’s about a feeling -- that feeling you get when the world isn’t perfect.  A globe that tilts and spins just like life tends to do.  And though it appears it might spill at any moment, the truth is… It’s far more balanced than you.  But the spinning globe whiskey glass isn’t just about balance or power either.  It’s about fun and freedom and enjoying the finer things because...why not?  Don’t order this if you just need a whiskey glass. Those are a dime a dozen.  Order this to remind you to live, and to have fun...fun with a friend because it comes in a set of two.  Guaranteed to arrive at your door unsmashed Formed of thick, durable glass for daily use Fun and conversational, yet completely balanced Global pattern with map creates an exotic feel of class  Comes in a set of 2 spinning whiskey glasses This is for those who see life for what it is -- seemingly flawed, yet flawless in it’s own way","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uXSViEjdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prestige Decanters","source_asin":"B075NSRP12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075NSRP12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075NSRP12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
