window.products.push({"id":780351,"name":"J. Sayuri Human Brain Art - 8.5\" x 8.5\" Watercolor Print - Colorful Neurology, Neuroscience, and Psychology Wall Decor - Holiday and Christmas Gifts f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJmkdto7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This human brain art print is a great gift idea for friends and family in neuroscience, veterinary sciences, psychology, and neurology. This signed human brain artwork makes great awards and gift idea for a graduation or white coat ceremony and looks great as wall decor in medical offices and therapy practices. In J. Sayuri's Animal Brains brain art print series, she creates unique watercolor neuroscience inspired artwork by embedding abstract watercolor paintings within coronal cross-sections of various animal brains, like this Human (Homo sapiens) brain. J. Sayuri makes these colorful and vibrant Animal Brain prints in a conscious effort to create a dialogue between neurology and art and brain technology and psychology. PRINT SPECIFICATIONS: - Measures 8.5 inch x 8.5 inch (21.6 cm x 21.6 cm) - Safely shipped in a durable clear plastic slip with a sturdy backing board - Includes both the common (human) and scientific (homo sapiens) name - Proudly signed by the artist - This print is also available in a record-sized (12\" x 12\") - Frame NOT included The human brain is a powerful organ that neurologists work tirelessly to understand. I appropriate real neurological brain slide images (fMRI) to create the intricate shapes of the brain with my watercolor paintings. Thank you to the Department of Physiology at the University of Wisconsin-Madison, Michigan State University, the National Museum of Health and Medicine, and other brain collection contributors for providing an enormously accessible collection of neurological images to curious minds. ** All Rights Reserved by the Aritst **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJmkdto7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J. Sayuri","source_asin":"B06VWJJFKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06VWJJFKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06VWJJFKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
