window.products.push({"id":780480,"name":"Artera Wicker Wall Basket Decor - Set of 3 Oversized, Hanging Natural Woven Seagrass Flat Baskets, Round Boho Wall Basket Decor for Living Room or Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jp7aUk5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY AND HIGH QUALITY. These baskets are imported, Made in Vietnam, 100% natural seagrass and completely woven by hands of skillful Vietnamese artisans to ensure high product quality. EASY TO HANG: Each wall basket comes with a hook, this makes it an easy to setup on any wall just use the hanger on the back of the boho basket for wall and customize your space to your liking OUTSTANDING DECOR IDEA. These baskets can delight your walls and fix with most of vintage styles like Boho. Woven baskets are perfect additions to the patio, garden, balcony, living rooms, bedrooms, hallway, gallery, etc. as they will pop color to your monotonous walls to make it a more lovely, decorative and stylish one. VERSATILE, STURDY FOR STORAGE. You can additionally use these baskets to conveniently store and organize food, bread, fruits, utensils, toys or any other small household stuff or send these as a gift to your friends, love ones, relatives, family on birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, New Year, or any other celebrations. NOTICE. Kindly make allowances for slight variations due to handcrafted nature of these goods. Also, do not submerge or wash these directly with even a bit of hot water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jp7aUk5XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artera Home","source_asin":"B09BMX3JJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BMX3JJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BMX3JJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":780481,"name":"Wide Mouth Mason Jars 12 oz, 12 PACK Glass Canning Jars with Metal Airtight Lids, Leak-Proof Colored Lids, Chalkboard Labels and Marker, for Meal Prep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BgEfSHi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12oz MASON JARS SET INCLUDES: 12 glass mason jars, 12 metal separable airtight lids, 12 colorful lids with silicone sealing rings, 16 writable stickers and a white marker. Each jar is 3 1/2 inches in height, 3 1/2 inches in mouth’s width, and 12oz (355ml) in capacity. PREMIUM GLASS AND AIRTIGHT LIDS: The jars are made of superior food-grade glass, healthy, lead-free and dishwasher safe. The metal lid is lined with a BPA-free sealable plastisol. The colorful plastic lids can be used with or without the leak-proof silicone ring. The blank label stickers can be written in white (chalk marks included), which gives you the option of placing labels on the side of the jar or on the lid. VISIBLE, SEALABLE, CLASSIFIABLE DESIGN: High transparency glass designs to be really visible to see what’s inside when piled up with many jars. The split metal cover is specially designed for fermentation with excellent airtightness. Plastic lids come with silicone rings for enhanced tightness are available in four colors for better classification or you can directly mark the categories on the label. CAN STORE WITH MANY KINDS: The proper capacity and wide opening of the jar is ideal for storing diverse of fruits and vegetables or any other stuff you may want to place in it like homemade pickles, tomatoes, sauerkraut, salmon, smoked mackerel and pumpkins, also great for grains, candy, jam, kidney beans, olive, peppers, fusilli, gravy and preserves, etc. MULTIPURPOSE IN MANY OCCASIONS: It has many uses in fermentation, canning and storage in everyday homes and kitchens, and also for placing some ready-to-eat foods that need to be opened frequently, even can be used for dry or liquid storage in restaurant and warehouse freezer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BgEfSHi5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOZITA","source_asin":"B08PV8GZL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PV8GZL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PV8GZL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
