window.products.push({"id":780550,"name":"MITLOXX Decorative Wall Hooks, Bird Hooks Wall Mounted, Plastic Bird & Wooden Peg, Decorative Hooks for Hanging Things-Coat, Towel, Hat etc. Pack of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Jj-IjcHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY BORING: Wall hook is in every home but why boring? This bird hook is not an ordinary cold piece but a wall art and nice decorative accent to your space, wherever they are, brings you a nature and vivid feel, highlights your space and make it look modern, smart UNIQUE DESIGN: Design is an element. This bird wall hook appears a simple look but each of the lines was scrutinized before publication. Thanks to the combination of nature wood grain and warm solid color. Concealed mounting system made the product a harmonious piece without any hardware being seen. Groove on peg prevent hangings fall off the rack MULTIPLE APPLICATION: Great for hanging coat, hat, scarf, belt, jacket, headphone, back pack, purse, towel, guitar, dog leash, umbrella, plant, key, bag, it performs as an organizer for entryway, living room, bedroom, closet, bathroom, laundry room, kitchen, cute decor to kids room, also could be an interesting idea to office, studio, restaurant, coffee bar, fashion shop, store etc, good match for all type of interiors such as midcentury, mordern, scandinavian, boho, farmhouse QUALITY MATTERS: Quality is the backbone. This bird hook is made of sustainably selected European solid beech wood for the peg and premium REACH compliant ABS for the bird, each pieces has been carefully treated in every process to come out with this wonderful piece STRONG & DURABLE: The bird hook is designed with 2-point fixing system instead of 1 which made it stay strong on wall, weight bearing up to 15lbs. Mounting anchors and screws with 1 extra included in the package. Anchors not required for wooden wall PICK IT UP! Let this bird fly into your space, fun in function!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Jj-IjcHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MITLOXX","source_asin":"B09B6FR4SD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B6FR4SD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B6FR4SD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
