window.products.push({"id":780670,"name":"Sggvecsy Halloween Wreath 30 LED Orange Lighted Artificial Handmade Halloween Wreath Sign Gnome Mesh Decor Front Door Decorations with Rose for Indoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9150KgSgnkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY & MATERIAL: The diameter of the wreath is 15.7inch which is made of high density black net and behind is strong metal base. The wreath is packed in a relatively small box due to transportation, please kindly unfold ornaments fully to achieve its actual size. Long lasting wreath never fall apart, allowing to use several festival seasons, only look vivid realistic and beautiful. UNIQUE HALLOWEEN WREATH: The orange lighted artificial handmade halloween wreath decorated with multiple festival elements, such as dotted gnome, 30 orange LED lights, orange rose, black leaves and colorful ribbons.The elements are very rich and full, sending out the atmosphere of Halloween. LIGHT UP HALLOWEEN: We provide pre-lit 30 LED orange lights for the wreath, emitting a faint ghostly purple light in the dark, adding your Halloween a bit of mystery and weird atmosphere. Required 2 AAA batteries (Not Included). The low-power-consumption light allows you to place them anywhere without the worry of needing a plug socket nearby. VERSATILE DECOR：The creepy wreath is perfect for decorating front door, walls,doorways,window,mantels,fireplace,indoor,outdoor,party and mantle on Halloween seasons. Apart from being the perfect Halloween decoration, it is also a wonderful Halloween gift to be sent to your family and friends. You may feel that opening the door is about to welcome an unimaginable world of horror. EASY OPERATION: The wreath is easy to set up, all of the wreath is pre-lit, just take it out from the box and adjust a little, then hang it at anywhere you want to dispaly,creating a strong Halloween creepy atmosphere. Especially a great choice for kids, friends and neighbors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9150KgSgnkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sggvecsy","source_asin":"B0B5RVZYYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5RVZYYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5RVZYYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
