window.products.push({"id":780677,"name":"44 fl oz Electric Airtight Coffee Container with Intelligent Leak Prevention System and Date Tracker, One Charge for 3 Months of Continuous Operation,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717EsO-RASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Smart Auto-monitoring System】 Intelligent pressure control system monitors pressure levels 24 hours a day. If a drop in pressure is detected, the electric airtight jar is automatically repressurized to maintain the vacuum state, while preventing food bugs and spoilage. Therefore, you will never have to worry about leak air and affecting your coffee storage. 【Extra Long Working Hours】The lid of the electric sealed jar is rechargeable, assuming you only need to open it 5 times a day, it can be used for 2-3 months when fully charged. If you want to remove the lid, just toggle the center button and the container will begin to deflate and be ready to open in seconds. 【Never Forget the Shelf Life Again】You can set the storage or expiry dates with the date tracker on the lid of your coffee storage container. No handwritten labels or notes required, you can know accurately when they were stored and if they are ok to eat. 【One-touch Vacuum Seal】Long press on the key, the white light is on to indicate power on; red light indicates power off, click once on the key, the white light flashes, at this time the electric vacuum tank begins to pump vacuum, click again to pause work, please note: only the power on state will automatically pump vacuum, the lid is not suitable for water washing, because it has an integrated pump, so the lid should be wiped with a clean damp cloth. 【Health and Safety】The coffee electric vacuum containers are made of high quality borosilicate glass, so you can store your food completely safely without worrying about any chemicals leaching into your coffee beans or coffee grounds. The glass food storage are transparent, so you can always monitor the amount of food left and freshness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717EsO-RASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVE MOMENT","source_asin":"B09XDW3JLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDW3JLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDW3JLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
