window.products.push({"id":780776,"name":"Tabletop Rooster Deluxe Flour Sack 50'S Kitchen Towel Vl21","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rt5oerHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our most colorful \"deluxe\" rooster is printed on cotton flour sack. A fun, vintage design perfect for the kitchen! 100% Cotton Flour Sack towel measures 17\" x 24\" Flour Sack towels were originally made from just that, flour sacks. The soft bags that held flour were re-purposed by industrious housewives who turned the flour sacks into not just kitchen or dish towels, but also pillowcases, doll's clothing, stuffed toys, and quilt blocks. Today, our Flour Sack Towels come with the same soft 100% cotton material, and are lint-free, making them perfect for multiple uses in the kitchen. From covering bowls of rising dough, to drying delicate dishes, our flour sack towels are sure to become your go to kitchen towel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rt5oerHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Red & White Kitchen Co.","source_asin":"B003WXINC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WXINC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WXINC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
