window.products.push({"id":780789,"name":"Small Dehumidifier for Home, Fitug 35oz Dehumidifiers for 350 Sq.Ft with 7 Color Light Timer 3 Modes Ultra Quiet Portable Mini Dehumidifier for Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vubx9GXPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿🎁👍【Compact and Portable】: Fitug quiet dehumidifier features hidden grip design. This compact and lightweight dehumidifier for bedroom can be easily moved anywhere (such as bedroom, living room, bathroom, study room, RV, basement, closet, kitchen, camper, laundry room, grow tent, travel trailer etc.), and meet your quick dehumidification need. Especially perfect for rooms up to 3300 Cubic Feet (350 sq ft). 🌿🎁👍【Auto Shut Off & Ultra Quiet】: This 1000ml water tank dehumidifier will automatically shut off when the water tank is full to prevent water overflow, and protect the device from damage. Fitug dehumidifiers for bathroom adopt advanced noise-cancelling technology that operates at whisper,quieter than compressor dehumidifiers. Noise level as low as 23dB, whether you are working or sleeping, it can gently care for your family! 🌿🎁👍【High Energy Efficient Dehumidification】This bedroom dehumidifier design with upgraded semiconductor high-efficiency condensation and dehumidification technology, it can quickly condense water in air to achieve rapid dehumidification. Super energy-saving, the basement dehumidifier uses power as low as 0.5 kWh/day. Keep your living environment dry and comfortable at the least cost! 🌿🎁👍【1000ML Water Tank & Easy to Use】: The home dehumidifiers adopt detachable 1L large-capacity visual reservoir design, you no longer trouble to frequently pour water . Super easy to operate, just unbox and plug in. Touch button design, one key to start wonderful dehumidification journey. 🌿🎁👍【Intelligent Timing & 7 Colorful LED Light】: The dehumidifier for RV with timing function, you can freely set at 4H, 8H, and 12H. The safe dehumidifier is equipped with colorful light supporting breathing RGB color mode, fixed color mode, and on/off function. If you need colorful night light to decorate your wonderful night, this smart dehumidifier is just right for you! 🌿🎁👍【3 Working Modes】: The closet dehumidifiers have 3 working modes: dehumidification mode, timing mode, light mode. Choose any one mode or combine use,as you like. It's not only a dehumidifier for home but also a nice gift for your family and friends! 🌿🎁👍【Exquisite Package & Worry-free Purchase】: The small dehumidifier for basement is packaged in exquisite color box. An ideal gift for yourself ,and for family or friends! If you have any question with our silent dehumidifier, please feel free to \"Ask a question\" to us . We provide you with lifetime friendly customer support!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vubx9GXPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fitug","source_asin":"B09Y1Z1LG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1Z1LG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1Z1LG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
