window.products.push({"id":780886,"name":"Bamboo Bread Box + Wood Cutting Board + Bamboo Ceramic Knife - No Logo - Food Storage - Non Toxic - Eco Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71he20QGC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why put up with metal bread boxes that dent and rust, or those with moving parts that bind and break? Our Holt & Oden Bread Box set provides superior quality and value to similar products because: - Our bread box with its built-in cutting board, is convenient, simply elegant and will stand the test of time. - The bread box and lid have no moving parts to bind or break, no metal to dent or rust. - The bamboo bread box is made of eco-friendly, non-toxic bamboo fiber that is biodegradable and incredibly strong. - This bread keeper naturally keeps bread storage and other baked goods fresh longer, increasing the value of your grocery shopping and home baking. - The bamboo cutting board or serving tray features attractive crumb catcher grooves to keep your counter top and table clean. - You can clean the bread bin in the dishwasher – it will never break, rust or warp! The lid is easily hand washed and dried. - This bread basket won’t take much space on your counter – leaving more room in the cupboard and pantry. - Our bread container is also cleverly used for crafts, make-up and jewelry, the crumb grooves keeping beads and accessories organized. We have a no hassle 100% guarantee refund policy. If you do not love your Holt & Oden Bread Box, simply return for a full refund, no questions asked. Who do you know that would also love this bread box? Add another one to your cart as a gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71he20QGC3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holt & Oden","source_asin":"B074NXCQ79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074NXCQ79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074NXCQ79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
