window.products.push({"id":780909,"name":"Double Sided Tape for Rugs, ActFun Non Slip Anti Curling Rug Grippers for Tile Floors, Corner Side Gripper for Hardwood Floors and Tile Grip Carpet Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wvaDagOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Tripping -- These rug grippers for area rugs so much adhere to the floor that there is no fear of falling. No more tripping! The product uses extra adhesive material to have a perfect grip on the rugs and the floor surface. They fit nicely on the corners, and you can't even notice them. It is exceptionally safe for the kids when they play. The carpet tape secures it to the place so that there is no movement and no fear of falling. Washable, Remove, Clean and Reuse -- The rug grippers are removable and reusable. You can quickly remove and rinse them off with water to remove the dust. After cleaning, drying in the air, they are as good as new with the same sticky properties. The adhesive does not damage the floor in any way. You can even put small rugs in the washing machine without removing the rug grippers, and they won't come out. Easy Installation -- It's a breeze to install them on the bottom of a rug. You can remove the adhesive tape layer and press hard to adhere it to the surface. Make sure to remove any dust particles on the surface before using the grippers. The Large Trapezoidal Design Ensures That The Rugs Wouldn't Curl Anymore -- You can keep the corner of the carpets stable by using these specially designed trapezoidal grippers. The adhesive prevents your carpets from curling at all. The edges won't slide or move and will stay firm in place. Versatile on Multiple Surfaces -- The Rug grippers are so versatile that they can be used literally on any service, be it hardwood, marble, laminates, stairs, or any slick flooring. Rest assured that the rug grippers will work extra time to hold the corner flat on the surface for a long time. It is to reiterate that you should apply it only on a clean surface to get the best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wvaDagOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ActFun","source_asin":"B09LCK59ML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LCK59ML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LCK59ML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
