window.products.push({"id":780914,"name":"Airead Stainless Steel Apple Corer Slicer Peeler Fruit Vegetable Peeler Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qdrY3k2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High quality Material】This apple peeler is made from Ultra-Strong Die Cast stainless steel, which means it won’t rust and is very durable not brittle steel for greater stability and strength. It can be in contact with water for a long time, and will not be corroded by juice. Rust-proof chrome plated winding rod and 3 prong extension with safety cap. Stainless steel blades and chrome plated parts and poly handle. 【Easy To Use】Apple Peeling Machine for peeling, coring, and slicing apples simultaneously in just seconds with an easy turn of the handle. Slices and cores at the same time, or just peels without coring or slicing. Coring/slicing blade can be removed for potatoes. Easy-crank-handle eliminates hand fatigue associated with paring knives and corers. Much more fun and efficient to use than a knife chopper or a handheld skinner cutter gadget tool. 【Multifunction】🍏🍎The Apple Peeler, Slicer, and Corer is perfect for pies, tarts, salads, and canning. 🍐🥔And the peelers is good for remove the peel of potato, cucumbers, citrus, orange, lemon, grapefruit, lime. Quickly and almost effortlessly prepare apples or other fruits & vegetables all types of salads, meals and healthy treats,apple pie and anything do you Snacks by apple peeler and corer. Peeling blade can be adjusted for a thick or thin peel. Easy to wash and clean. 【Safe to Use】It is made of food-grade materials, without any food safety issues. It will not chemically react with food. The rubber base at the bottom will make it firmly fixed on the desktop, even if children use it will not have any safety issues. Powerful Rubber Vacuum Base holds onto tabletop for tremendous stability. Firmly grips smooth, non-porous surfaces. Excellent peeler for seniors and those with arthritis. Because it needs no electricity, you can use it anywhere. 【Application】Great for apple pies or pear fruit tarts, potato au gratin, or fresh apple slices in cool spiral shapes for kids after school snacks. Easy to wash and clean. Hand washing recommended for stainless steel parts. Wipe cast iron body clean with damp cloth and warm,soapy water. Quality BPA free food-grade materials. Unconditional return or replacement within 30 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qdrY3k2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Airead","source_asin":"B08YRTHRSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-780914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YRTHRSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YRTHRSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
